==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crocodylidae Kurocroc]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn after 61.33 seconds<sup>1,840f</sup>, delay 46.67~48 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,440f</sup>.

